<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>EngZa Apps - Official Landing Page</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }
        body {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5, #3b82f6);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 20px;
        }
        .profile-img {
            width: 100px;
            height: 100px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 3px solid white;
            object-fit: cover;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }
        header h1 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        header p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: -30px auto 40px auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }
        .section {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
        .section h2 {
            color: #1e293b;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .section p {
            color: #64748b;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #4f46e5;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 10px;
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #4338ca;
        }
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <!-- এখানে আপনার ছবির লিংক বা লোগো বসাতে পারেন -->
        <!-- <img src="YOUR_IMAGE_LINK_HERE" alt="Developer Profile" class="profile-img"> -->
        <h1>EngZa Apps</h1>
        <p>Enhance your learning experience with our innovative mobile applications.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="section">
            <h2>About Our App</h2>
            <p>Welcome to the official portal of <strong>EngZa</strong>. Our application is meticulously designed to deliver a seamless, efficient, and interactive English learning experience, helping users master the language effortlessly.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
            <p>We deeply respect your privacy. Our apps do not collect or store any unauthorized personal data from users. All data processing is kept secure, safe, and transparent in accordance with Google Play policies.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>Contact & Support</h2>
            <p>If you have any questions, feedback, or support queries regarding our apps, feel free to reach out to us directly via email.</p>
            <usufali2004.bd@gmail.com>
            <a href="mailto:your-email@gmail.com" class="btn">Get in Touch</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        &copy; 2026 EngZa Apps. All rights reserved.
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
